  "items": [
    {
      "source": "the MockMvcWebClientBuilder to customize",
      "translation": "使用 MockMvcWebClientBuilder 进行自定义。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>MockMvcWebClientBuilder</code> based on the supplied\n<a href=\"../../../../web/context/WebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.context\"><code>WebApplicationContext</code></a> and <a href=\"../setup/MockMvcConfigurer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.web.servlet.setup\"><code>MockMvcConfigurer</code></a>.",
      "translation": "基于提供的<a href=\"../../../../web/context/WebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.context\"><code>WebApplicationContext</code></a>和<a href=\"../setup/MockMvcConfigurer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.web.servlet.setup\"><code>MockMvcConfigurer</code></a>创建一个新的<code>MockMvcWebClientBuilder</code>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>MockMvcWebClientBuilder</code> based on the supplied\n<a href=\"../../../../web/context/WebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.context\"><code>WebApplicationContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "基于提供的<a href=\"../../../../web/context/WebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.context\"><code>WebApplicationContext</code></a>创建一个新的<code>MockMvcWebClientBuilder</code>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Supply the <code>WebClient</code> that the client <a href=\"#build()\">built</a>\nby this builder should delegate to when processing\nnon-<a href=\"WebRequestMatcher.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.web.servlet.htmlunit\">matching</a> requests.",
      "translation": "提供由该构建器构建的客户端 <a href=\"#build()\">构建</a> 时应委托给它的 <code>WebClient</code>，用于处理非 <a href=\"WebRequestMatcher.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.web.servlet.htmlunit\">匹配</a> 的请求。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>context</code> - the <code>WebApplicationContext</code> to create a <a href=\"../MockMvc.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.web.servlet\"><code>MockMvc</code></a>\ninstance from; never <code>null</code>",
      "translation": "<code>context</code> - 用于从中创建 <a href=\"../MockMvc.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.web.servlet\"><code>MockMvc</code></a> 实例的 <code>WebApplicationContext</code>；绝不能为 <code>null</code>",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "The <code>MockMvc</code> instance used by the builder may be\n<a href=\"#mockMvcSetup(org.springframework.test.web.servlet.MockMvc)\">supplied directly</a> or created transparently\nfrom a <a href=\"#webAppContextSetup(org.springframework.web.context.WebApplicationContext)\"><code>WebApplicationContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "构建器使用的 `<code>MockMvc</code>` 实例可以<a href=\"#mockMvcSetup(org.springframework.test.web.servlet.MockMvc)\">直接提供</a>，也可以从 <a href=\"#webAppContextSetup(org.springframework.web.context.WebApplicationContext)\"><code>WebApplicationContext</code></a><a href=\"#webAppContextSetup(org.springframework.web.context.WebApplicationContext)\">透明创建</a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The returned client will use the configured <a href=\"../MockMvc.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.web.servlet\"><code>MockMvc</code></a> instance\nfor processing any <a href=\"WebRequestMatcher.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.web.servlet.htmlunit\">matching</a> requests\nand a delegate <code>WebClient</code> for all other requests.",
      "translation": "返回的客户端将使用配置的<a href=\"../MockMvc.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.web.servlet\"><code>MockMvc</code></a>实例来处理任何<a href=\"WebRequestMatcher.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.web.servlet.htmlunit\">匹配</a>的请求，并使用委托的<code>WebClient</code>处理所有其他请求。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If a <a href=\"#withDelegate(org.htmlunit.WebClient)\">delegate</a> has been explicitly configured,\nit will be used; otherwise, a default <code>WebClient</code> will be configured\nas the delegate.",
      "translation": "如果已显式配置了<a href=\"#withDelegate(org.htmlunit.WebClient)\">委托</a>，则使用它；否则，将配置默认的<code>WebClient</code>作为委托。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>MockMvcWebClientBuilder</code> based on the supplied\n<a href=\"../MockMvc.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.web.servlet\"><code>MockMvc</code></a> instance.",
      "translation": "基于提供的<a href=\"../MockMvc.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.web.servlet\"><code>MockMvc</code></a>实例创建一个新的<code>MockMvcWebClientBuilder</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>mockMvc</code> - the <code>MockMvc</code> instance to use; never <code>null</code>",
      "translation": "<code>mockMvc</code> - 要使用的 <code>MockMvc</code> 实例；绝不能为 <code>null</code>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>configurer</code> - the <code>MockMvcConfigurer</code> to apply; never <code>null</code>",
      "translation": "<code>configurer</code> - 要应用的 <code>MockMvcConfigurer</code>；绝不 <code>null</code>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>webClient</code> - the <code>WebClient</code> to delegate to for requests\nthat do not match; never <code>null</code>",
      "translation": "<code>webClient</code> - 用于委托不匹配请求的 <code>WebClient</code>；绝不 <code>null</code>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "the <code>WebClient</code> to use",
      "translation": "使用的<code>WebClient</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Build the <code>WebClient</code> configured via this builder.",
      "translation": "通过此构建器构建<code>WebClient</code>。",
